  "promptExampleId": "example-08",
  "prompt": "A 12-second impact study on the boxing set. Begin in an eye-level, three-quarter-right long shot of the approaching fist and follow it at 10% scene speed. At the first surface contact between fist and target, stop translating the camera, switch scene speed to 4 times normal, and zoom optically into the impact point, centring it by the end. Keep the event tied to contact, not an invented playback timestamp.",
